    "body": "So in 6.4.1 in _attempt to populate the history entry's document_ (covering the case of navigating to a document without a DOM) seems to run a the navigation failed steps (and so emits a navigation failed event), but the document isn't null in that case so we'll still send the navigation committed event in 7.4. Possibly we need to move emitting this event up into step 6?\r\n\r\n",
