    "body": "thanks @domenic It sounds like WebDriver BiDi would be interested in all situations when documentIsNew. I have updated the PR and moved the call to \"update document for history step application\" before any document scripts may run. \r\n\r\n@jgraham could you please take a look at the proposal as well? ",
